00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:21.000
It involved a certain letter that got dropped in your mailbox. What was it like to receive this letter? Yes, a department merit review committee would review every faculty member's, what we call an APR. It's like a annual productivity report. And it has things like how many papers we wrote,

