known as growth mindset. Could you explain what a growth mindset is as well as its opposite, a fixed mindset? Yes, the growth mindset is oftentimes characterized as a belief that talent and ability and performance, all of these skills, they're potentials that we can grow with the right support, asking for help, trying new strategies, and the opposite of the growth mindset is the fixed mindset. And this is the belief that talent, ability, skills,

