a difficult math class or a very large chemistry 400 person auditorium class. They might say, look to your left, look to your right, only one of you is gonna be here at the end of the semester, right? I couldn't think of anything more zero sum than that. My professor said 30% of you will fail, 20% of you are gonna get Ds at the end of the term. It happens every year and it will happen this year to you.

