00:31:32.000 --> 00:32:00.000
and as different groups have tried to replicate them, they take different kinds of strategies in that replication. They might try different kinds of outcomes. And we are seeing variability in these results over time, where some studies are replicating these these results over time, where some studies are replicating these effects and in others there's finding challenges in finding effects or as large of effects as some of the original studies had shown. I want to talk a moment, Mary, about how some people have taken this mixed bag of results

