00:34:03.000 --> 00:34:24.000
where they were creating these cultures of genius. And this is why cultures of growth are really crucial for helping us get into, stay in, and then maximize the benefits of our growth mindset. If we have a strong culture of genius around us, there's gonna be very few opportunities for us to actually engage in the process of learning, to make mistakes, to raise our hand and say,

